# =============================================================================
# Swiggy Nexus — environment examples
# =============================================================================
# The Next.js app reads variables from frontend/.env.local (not this file).
# Copy frontend/.env.example → frontend/.env.local and adjust there.
#
# Optional — when running backend/ locally (uvicorn / Docker / Procfile):
# FRONTEND_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000
# CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,https://your-app.vercel.app
#
# Offline mock MCP (bundled): same uvicorn exposes POST /food, /im, /dineout
# LOCAL_MCP_HTTP=1  # optional; use uvicorn --workers 2 when nested SSE calls MCP
# LOCAL_MCP_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8000
# See docs/local-mock-mcp.md
#
# Production Swiggy MCP: https://mcp.swiggy.com — docs/swiggy-builders-club.md
